  "prefLabel": "Mavs 303.01 Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 303.01 Responsibilities.\n\n(a) The adjutant general shall supervise the execution of the national guard enlistment incentive program.\n\n(b) The adjutant general shall:\n\n(1) Delegate program management to New Hampshire army national guard and New Hampshire air national guard; and\n\n(2) Appoint enlistment incentive program managers.\n\n(c) Enlistment incentive program manager(s) shall:\n\n(1) Ensure resources and systems shall be in place to administer program;\n\n(2) Certify enlistment incentive payments; and\n\n(3) Monitor program effectiveness.\n\n(d) The department shall process certified enlistment incentive payments.\n\nSource. #13459-B, eff 10-14-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mavs300.html"
